Unicode data vendored for scripts/generate_confusables.py

confusables.txt
  What:    UTS #39 (Unicode Security Mechanisms) confusables data, Unicode 18.0.0
  URL:     https://www.unicode.org/Public/security/latest/confusables.txt
  Dated:   2026-08-06, 01:05:35 GMT (the file's own header)
  Fetched: 2026-10-06
  sha256:  6ed3ee967c9dfdf6677d563c9985182fbc50a2efb7d6059cd57b2e2ce18f5b92
  Licence: Unicode License v3 (https://www.unicode.org/license.txt); the file's
           copyright header is kept verbatim. Attribution is in /NOTICE.

  The generator refuses any other bytes. To update: fetch the new file into a
  fresh directory, review the diff against this one, then change PINNED_SHA256
  and UNICODE_VERSION in scripts/generate_confusables.py and this README
  together, and regenerate.

forage_supplement.tsv
  Forage's own owner-reviewed additions (2026-10-06). Not Unicode data; covered
  by the repository's Apache-2.0 licence. Format and rules are in its header.

These files are build inputs only. .dockerignore keeps scripts/ out of the
image; only the generated pipeline/confusables.py ships.
